{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"luxun-e-o010b","title":"陆议至陆口致关羽书谦下称功","accounts":[{"id":"luxun-e-o010b-account","label":"《陆逊传第十三》正文","text":"陆议至陆口致关羽书谦下称功","evidence":["luxun-e-o010b-q"]},{"id":"luxun-a-o011-judgment","label":"《陆逊传》正文","text":"陆议书称关羽获于禁之功，以晋文、淮阴为比，又告诫防徐晃与曹操增兵。","evidence":["luxun-q-o011-judgment"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xianzhu-p0115","role":"致书","evidence":["luxun-e-o010b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0172","role":"收书","evidence":["luxun-e-o010b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"陆议代吕蒙时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["luxun-e-o010b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"luxun-e-o010b-q","source_order":[58,38,"O010b"],"order":10300}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0172","name":"关羽","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0115","name":"陆逊","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"luxun-e-o010b-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-3bb65e70d18f79758580","layer":"original","quote":"逊至陆口，书与羽曰：“前承观衅而动〖10〗，以律行师〖11〗；小举大克，一何巍巍！〖12〗敌国败绩，利在同盟，闻庆拊节〖13〗；想遂席卷〖14〗，共奖王纲〖15〗。近以不敏〖16〗，受任来西；延慕光尘〖17〗，思禀良规。”","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":37,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":17,"end":128,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-o011-judgment","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-89a63235c02353fb2a37","layer":"original","quote":"又曰：“于禁等见获，遐迩欣叹。以为将军之勋，足以长世〖18〗。虽昔晋文城濮之师〖19〗，淮阴拔赵之略〖20〗：蔑以尚兹〖21〗！闻徐晃等步骑驻旌〖22〗，窥望麾葆〖23〗。操猾虏也，忿不思难；恐潜增众，以逞其心；虽云师老〖24〗，犹有骁悍。且战捷之后，常苦轻敌；古人杖术〖25〗，军胜弥警〖26〗。愿将军广为方计，以全独克。仆书生疏迟〖27〗，忝所不堪〖28〗；喜邻威德，乐自倾尽；虽未合策，犹可怀也〖29〗。傥明注仰〖30〗，有以察之。”","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":220,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
